{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日下午8時45分發出偏北強風警告，提醒市民注意即時天氣情況。預料本港將吹偏北強風，海面可能出現大浪，對海上活動構成潛在危險。市民應避免前往海邊或參與水上活動，以確保安全。\n</p>\n<p>此外，受強風影響，戶外活動可能面臨挑戰。建議市民妥善固定家中物品，尤其是容易被風吹走的物件，以減少意外發生的風險。駕駛人士亦需提高警覺，留意道路情況，並避免在強風下行駛大型車輛。</p>\n<p>天文台將密切監察天氣變化，並提供最新資訊。市民可透過天文台網站或手機應用程式獲取即時更新，確保安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b7%e9%a2%a8%e8%ad%a6%e5%91%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">強風警告</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 9 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.150783+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:30:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:24.058514+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:24.058514+00:00","content_hash":"7f110ee3584ee99302ca7914419c3fc2f822829e2f833e9f5adb9682d09e95de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}